window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-bb9b0fb8d058b9c9"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"developer-commands\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">开发者命令</h1> <blockquote> <p>如需完整的文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 后添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>可以在 VS Code 的命令面板中使用这些命令控制 Codex，也可以为它们绑定键盘快捷键。</p> <p><a id=\"assign-a-key-binding\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">分配按键绑定</h2> <p>若要为 Codex 命令分配或更改按键绑定：</p> <ol> <li>打开命令面板（macOS 按 <strong>Cmd+Shift+P</strong>，Windows/Linux 按 <strong>Ctrl+Shift+P</strong>）。</li> <li>运行 <strong>Preferences: Open Keyboard Shortcuts</strong>（首选项：打开键盘快捷方式）。</li> <li>搜索 <code>Codex</code> 或命令 ID（例如 <code>chatgpt.newChat</code>）。</li> <li>选择铅笔图标，然后输入所需的快捷键。</li> </ol> <p><a id=\"extension-commands\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">扩展命令</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>命令</th> <th>默认按键绑定</th> <th>说明</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>chatgpt.addToThread</code></td> <td>-</td> <td>将选中的文本范围作为当前聊天的上下文</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>chatgpt.addFileToThread</code></td> <td>-</td> <td>将整个文件作为当前聊天的上下文</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>chatgpt.newChat</code></td> <td>macOS: <code>Cmd+N</code><br>Windows/Linux: <code>Ctrl+N</code></td> <td>新建聊天</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>chatgpt.newCodexPanel</code></td> <td>-</td> <td>新建 Codex 面板</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>chatgpt.openCommandMenu</code></td> <td>-</td> <td>打开 Codex 命令菜单</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>chatgpt.openSidebar</code></td> <td>-</td> <td>打开 Codex 侧边栏面板</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>斜杠命令让你无需离开输入框即可控制 Codex。可以用它们检查状态、在本地模式和云端模式之间切换，或发送反馈。</p> <p><a id=\"use-a-slash-command\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">使用斜杠命令</h2> <ol> <li>在 Codex 输入框中键入 <code>/</code>。</li> <li>从列表中选择一条命令，或继续输入以筛选命令（例如 <code>/status</code>）。</li> <li>按 <strong>Enter</strong>。</li> </ol> <p><a id=\"available-slash-commands\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">可用的斜杠命令</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>斜杠命令</th> <th>说明</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>/approve</code></td> <td>自动审查已启用时，批准对最近一次自动审查拒绝进行一次重试。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/cloud</code></td> <td>云端执行可用时，在云端运行聊天。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/cloud-environment</code></td> <td>为聊天选择云端环境。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/compact</code></td> <td>压缩当前聊天的上下文。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/fast</code></td> <td>在可用时打开或关闭模型目录提供的 Fast 服务层级。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/feedback</code></td> <td>打开反馈对话框以提交反馈，并可选择附带日志。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/fork</code></td> <td>将一个本地聊天复制为新的本地聊天。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/goal</code></td> <td>设置一个供 Codex 持续推进的长期目标。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/ide-context</code></td> <td>打开或关闭自动 IDE 上下文。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/init</code></td> <td>为当前项目生成 <code>AGENTS.md</code> 框架。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/local</code></td> <td>在本地工作区中运行聊天。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/mcp</code></td> <td>打开 MCP 状态以查看已连接的服务器。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/memories</code></td> <td>记忆功能可用时，配置聊天能否使用或生成记忆。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/model</code></td> <td>为当前聊天选择模型。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/personality</code></td> <td>当前模型支持时，选择 Codex 的个性风格。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/plan</code></td> <td>切换用于多步骤规划的计划模式。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/project</code></td> <td>为新聊天选择项目。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/reasoning</code></td> <td>为当前聊天选择推理强度。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/review</code></td> <td>启动代码审查模式，以审查未提交的更改或与基础分支比较。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/side</code></td> <td>在不中断主聊天的情况下启动一个临时侧聊。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/status</code></td> <td>显示聊天 ID、上下文用量和速率限制。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/worktree</code></td> <td>在新的 Git worktree 中运行聊天。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table>","en":"<h1 id=\"developer-commands\">Developer commands</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>Use these commands to control Codex from the VS Code Command Palette. You can also bind them to keyboard shortcuts.</p> <h2 id=\"assign-a-key-binding\">Assign a key binding</h2> <p>To assign or change a key binding for a Codex command:</p> <ol> <li>Open the Command Palette (<strong>Cmd+Shift+P</strong> on macOS or <strong>Ctrl+Shift+P</strong> on Windows/Linux).</li> <li>Run <strong>Preferences: Open Keyboard Shortcuts</strong>.</li> <li>Search for <code>Codex</code> or the command ID (for example, <code>chatgpt.newChat</code>).</li> <li>Select the pencil icon, then enter the shortcut you want.</li> </ol> <h2 id=\"extension-commands\">Extension commands</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Command</th> <th>Default key binding</th> <th>Description</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>chatgpt.addToThread</code></td> <td>-</td> <td>Add selected text range as context for the current chat</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>chatgpt.addFileToThread</code></td> <td>-</td> <td>Add the entire file as context for the current chat</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>chatgpt.newChat</code></td> <td>macOS: <code>Cmd+N</code><br>Windows/Linux: <code>Ctrl+N</code></td> <td>Create a new chat</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>chatgpt.newCodexPanel</code></td> <td>-</td> <td>Create a new Codex panel</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>chatgpt.openCommandMenu</code></td> <td>-</td> <td>Open the Codex command menu</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>chatgpt.openSidebar</code></td> <td>-</td> <td>Open the Codex sidebar panel</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>Slash commands let you control Codex without leaving the composer. Use them to check status, switch between local and cloud mode, or send feedback.</p> <h2 id=\"use-a-slash-command\">Use a slash command</h2> <ol> <li>In the Codex composer, type <code>/</code>.</li> <li>Select a command from the list, or keep typing to filter (for example, <code>/status</code>).</li> <li>Press <strong>Enter</strong>.</li> </ol> <h2 id=\"available-slash-commands\">Available slash commands</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Slash command</th> <th>Description</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>/approve</code></td> <td>Approve one retry of a recent automatic-review denial, when automatic review is active.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/cloud</code></td> <td>Run the chat in the cloud, when cloud execution is available.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/cloud-environment</code></td> <td>Choose the cloud environment for the chat.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/compact</code></td> <td>Compact the current chat's context.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/fast</code></td> <td>Turn a catalog-provided Fast service tier on or off, when available.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/feedback</code></td> <td>Open the feedback dialog to submit feedback and optionally include logs.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/fork</code></td> <td>Copy a local chat into a new local chat.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/goal</code></td> <td>Set a persistent goal for Codex to work toward.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/ide-context</code></td> <td>Turn automatic IDE context on or off.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/init</code></td> <td>Generate an <code>AGENTS.md</code> scaffold for the current project.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/local</code></td> <td>Run the chat in your local workspace.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/mcp</code></td> <td>Open MCP status to view connected servers.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/memories</code></td> <td>Configure whether the chat can use or generate memories, when Memories is available.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/model</code></td> <td>Choose the model for the current chat.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/personality</code></td> <td>Choose how Codex responds, when the current model supports personalities.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/plan</code></td> <td>Toggle plan mode for multi-step planning.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/project</code></td> <td>Choose a project for new chats.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/reasoning</code></td> <td>Choose the reasoning effort for the current chat.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/review</code></td> <td>Start code review mode to review uncommitted changes or compare against a base branch.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/side</code></td> <td>Start a temporary side chat without interrupting the main chat.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/status</code></td> <td>Show the chat ID, context usage, and rate limits.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/worktree</code></td> <td>Run the chat in a new Git worktree.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table>"};
